        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Emergency Exit 5237 Knob With 5048 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid forged brass knobset has old world beauty. Baldwin's Bethpage knob features a beveled edge rose that only adds to the classic allure.  Concealed mounting means that the sleek look is not interrupted by unsightly screws; and because it is made by Baldwin from solid brass, you know that it is made with attention to both style and quality. This knobset will fit doors from 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/4 inches thick, and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. An emergency exit knob, the lock is activated by a key from the exterior or by a push-button located in the middle of the interior lever. Turning the interior lever will retract the latchbolt for immediate egress but will not unlock the exterior knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Emergency Exit:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is activated by a key from the exterior or by a push-button located in the middle of the interior lever. Turning the interior lever will automatically retract the latchbolt for immediate egress. The door will remain locked from the exterior. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/bethpage-knob-baldwin-5077\"><b>Interior Bethpage Knobset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5237 Bethpage Keyed Entry Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolt springs.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" 6 pin lock cylinder, pinned to 5</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Includes standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Bethpage Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Height:  2.51\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height:  3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection:  2.52\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt Throw:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" – 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bethpage Keyed Knobset, Baldwin 5237",
                "description": "This solid forged brass knobset has old world beauty. Baldwin's Bethpage knob features a beveled edge rose that only adds to the classic allure.  This knobset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. An emergency exit knob, the lock is activated by a key from the exterior or by a push-button located in the middle of the interior lever. Turning the interior lever will retract the latchbolt for immediate egress but will not unlock the exterior knob.",
